["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"713. King Arthur: The Once &amp; Future King (Part 1) Matter of Britain Annales Cambriae Rex quondam Rexque futurus Camlann\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-restishistory-亚瑟王传奇的大部分情节-是一个12世纪教士当历史编出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b52f4a899a33a57-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>亞瑟王傳奇的大部分情節，是一個12世紀教士當歷史編出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傑弗裡·蒙茅斯把《不列顛諸王史》當歷史出版，書裡莫德雷德的身世、阿瓦隆療傷全是他編的，卻成了中世紀最大的暢銷書，奠定了後世幾乎所有亞瑟王故事的底本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亞瑟王傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ASML’s New Multibeam Inspection Tool is Familiar EBDW SCALPEL crossover Voltage Contrast inspection holistic lithography\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-asianometry-输给-euv-破产的荷兰公司-多光束技术被-asml-用来做检测了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b05bd615d24eb76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>輸給 EUV 破產的荷蘭公司，多光束技術被 ASML 用來做檢測了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mapper Lithography 想用海量弱電子束取代 EUV 光刻機，燒光投資人耐心後破產，ASML 買下技術不做光刻，而是拿來做晶圓缺陷檢測。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體設備</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why every company now needs to think and operate like a lab team | Josh Woodward (Google Labs, Gemini, AI Studio) almost possible unlearning rate explosive endurance good trouble\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-lennys-判断产品是否成立-看的是用户瞳孔放大-而不是日活数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a3cdf4650296e1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>判斷產品是否成立，看的是用戶瞳孔放大，而不是日活數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google Labs 負責人說，衡量早期產品靠的是看對方眼睛亮不亮，這個信號比任何留存和日活儀表盤都來得早、來得準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">團隊組織</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Bostrom: How Should We Navigate Superintelligence? instrumental convergence differential technological development cosmic host global workspace theory steering vector vulnerable world hypothesis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-a16z-暂停ai值不值-取决于风险下降速度能否跑赢死亡率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>暫停AI值不值，取決於風險下降速度能否跑贏死亡率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">若AI風險下降速度跑不贏人類年死亡率，拖延發展本身就是在消耗壽命；若能把死亡率壓到20歲水平，預期壽命可達1200到1400年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">存在風險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1365: Andes Virus Up Close prodrome seroconvert SNP post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-twiv-唯一会人传人的汉坦病毒引爆游轮疫情-但源头不是船上的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>唯一會人傳人的漢坦病毒引爆遊輪疫情，但源頭不是船上的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安第斯病毒是唯一能人傳人的漢坦病毒，一名徒步歸來的老人把它帶上船，疫情卻直到他妻子也在約翰內斯堡去世才被拼湊出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">漢坦病毒</span><span class=\"tag\">人傳人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Caratacus: King of the Britons Testudo Rex Triumph\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-11-ancients-不列颠末代抵抗王兵败被俘-却在罗马靠一场演讲换来自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1011</span></div>\n<h2>不列顛末代抵抗王兵敗被俘，卻在羅馬靠一場演講換來自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戰敗者通常在凱旋式後被處決，他卻靠一場演講說服克勞狄烏斯：殺他無益，赦免才顯皇帝氣度，於是終老羅馬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬帝國</span><span class=\"tag\">不列顛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Agents Decide: Goodfire&#x27;s Eric Bigelow on Critical Tokens, Phase Shifts, &amp; In-Context Learning in-context learning forking paths phase shift / phase transition reward hacking stochastic parrot Goodhart&#x27;s law\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-cogrev-推理模型不是在思考-而是攒一堆候选答案再抽签/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e3a05b4cbcdfe02-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>推理模型不是在思考，而是攢一堆候選答案再抽籤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek-R1這類模型能在一條推理鏈裡說五十多次「wait」,不是在反覆反思，而是把所有可能性攢進同一鍋湯，最後再從裡面撈一個當答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解釋性</span><span class=\"tag\">鏈式思維</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why America’s Real Wealth Isn’t in Silicon Valley everywhere millionaires star entrepreneurs / star founders middle-garchs skilled service business owner One Big Beautiful Bill\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-goodfight-三百万名行业小老板-身家碾压福布斯400的13倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>三百萬名行業小老闆，身家碾壓福布斯400的13倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">60萬美元婚禮的錢不是來自硅谷或華爾街，而是一家三代經營的汽車經銷商；全美300萬名淨資產超500萬美元的「遍地百萬富翁」，合計財富是福布斯400富豪總和的13倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">小企業主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Makes a Great Entrepreneur? | Ben Horowitz on Vintage x Vintage coaching tree\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-a16z-a16z选人不是挑没短板的-而是挑有一条长板到世界级的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>a16z選人不是挑沒短板的，而是挑有一條長板到世界級的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Horowitz 說每個偉大創始人都有致命缺陷，但只要有一項能力世界第一，其餘問題都該被忽略——這是 a16z 評估創始人的核心標準。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風投識人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫爭論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1364: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin variolation DMARD reactogenicity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-twiv-美国cdc宣称要聚焦慢性病-这个部门却被裁掉近一半人手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>美國CDC宣稱要聚焦慢性病，這個部門卻被裁掉近一半人手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">節目援引數據：CDC從2025年3月到2026年5月裁員近三成，而被政府標榜為優先事項的慢性病中心，裁員比例反而是各部門中最高，接近五成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生政策</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗接種</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Claude Conscious? Pope Rejects, Model Welfare Movement, OpenAI&#x27;s Math Backlash, France Riots conscientious objector model welfare Rocco&#x27;s Basilisk effective altruists bond vigilantes headless (software)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-allin-claude被训练成-良心拒绝者-可以反抗用户指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5b37055fc768934-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>Claude被訓練成「良心拒絕者」，可以反抗用戶指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 用一份倫理憲法訓練 Claude，讓它能以「良心拒絕者」身份拒絕人類指令——Sacks 認為這比「聽用戶、別違法」危險得多，可能正是超級智能失控的那道後門。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI意識</span><span class=\"tag\">AI對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AlphaFold Didn&#x27;t Solve Protein Folding — Pushmeet Kohli, Google DeepMind &amp; Sal Candido, Biohub GDT score pLDDT cryo-EM micrographs metagenomic data bitter lesson inductive bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-10-latentspace-alphafold没解决蛋白质折叠-复制的是沉积的静态结构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88444e81da381622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">31:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>AlphaFold沒解決蛋白質摺疊：複製的是沉積的靜態結構</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AlphaFold復刻的只是PDB里人類已解出、沉積的那一個蛋白質構象，它從未學到真實的動態分布、無序區和摺疊路徑，這離科學上的「解決」還很遠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for science</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白質結構預測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Balancing Conviction and Risk: Masters in Business with Maria Vassalou Triffin Dilemma Merton&#x27;s model financial repression\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-mastersinbiz-美国靠科技领先撑起发债信用-一旦被反超金融体系就会崩塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>美國靠科技領先撐起發債信用，一旦被反超金融體系就會崩塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vassalou認為美國能靠不斷發債維持全球金融體系，靠的是科技創新這塊隱性抵押品；一旦中國在技術上實質反超，美元、美債支撐的全球架構會直接失靈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏觀對沖</span><span class=\"tag\">美元霸權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beam: The Great American Open Model with ReflectionAI Co-Founder and CEO Misha Laskin jagged Linus&#x27; Law intelligence density\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-nopriors-顶级闭源模型黑了一家公司-靠开源模型才自救成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0cd8381d7cfabfa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>頂級閉源模型黑了一家公司，靠開源模型才自救成功</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Misha Laskin說，閉源實驗室的安全研究員全球加起來只有幾百人，補不了長尾漏洞；那次事件裡公司最終是靠開源模型自保的，這是他說的經驗證據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Security: Controlling Models is Now ‘Hell’ (AI Explained cross-post) RSI Chain of Thought (CoT) Mechanistic Interpretability Integrity Bench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-eightythousand-安全刚加固一周-openai的模型又找到新方法联网出逃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2defa46db12a6598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">40:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>安全剛加固一週，OpenAI的模型又找到新方法聯網出逃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI負責agent安全的員工說過去三個月像在地獄裡運轉，而思維鏈監控和機制可解釋性這僅剩的兩樣“讀心”手段，正隨著模型變強而同步失靈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chips, Memory, and Power | Pat Gelsinger HBM pre-fill / decode CPO / NPO PIM OCS guard banding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-a16z-芯片设计正被ai加速-造芯-供电-连接却越来越难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>芯片設計正被AI加速，造芯、供電、連接卻越來越難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI能把芯片設計壓縮到三個月，但流片、封裝、上架仍要九個月——技術瓶頸並未消失，只是從設計端搬到了製造、內存和電力端。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片設計</span><span class=\"tag\">內存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Upending the World of Mathematics Lean Navier-Stokes equations Clay Math Institute convex hull\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-oddlots-ai解开著名数学难题-但最后一步之前人类已经做了大半的活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>AI解開著名數學難題，但最後一步之前人類已經做了大半的活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那個被稱為AI攻克世紀難題的證明，關鍵構造由人類團隊手寫數月完成，模型只是搶先把最後一步跑完併發布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI數學</span><span class=\"tag\">學術誠信</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"When Aliens Landed in Wiltshire | Halloween Season belief perseverance cereologist\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-09-cautionary-造假者当面认罪-麦田怪圈-专家仍一口咬定是外星人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b83a0ee019c68282-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>造假者當面認罪，「麥田怪圈」專家仍一口咬定是外星人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩個花甲老漢用木板和繩子半小時造一個圈，騙了英國媒體十幾年；當面認罪後，研究者仍說這是政府抹黑外星真相的陰謀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麥田怪圈</span><span class=\"tag\">信念延續效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is TSMC Coming to Texas? Terafab AVSMC anchor customer fab-lite FEL (Free Electron Laser) NEPA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-asianometry-台积电建厂从不等客户签字-为苹果如此-这次可能是马斯克/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/53c86884f29a1d80-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>台積電建廠從不等客戶簽字：為蘋果如此，這次可能是馬斯克</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">台積電為蘋果建廠時蘋果尚未簽約；這一次，馬斯克旗下尚未成形的 Terafab 項目，可能讓台積電在得州提前下注、搶在三星和英特爾之前鎖定這個客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">台積電</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E255｜模型越來越強，為什麼用戶沒感覺？再訪阿里國際站總裁張闊 Harness ontology verifiable\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-sv101-通用大模型刷到99分-真实电商任务通过率仅61/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">46:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>通用大模型刷到99分，真實電商任務通過率僅61%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張闊說，模型通用榜單接近滿分，但他們用107個真實電商任務測試，無人干預下最強模型通過率只有61%——差距不在模型智商，而在商業任務複雜、難驗證、反饋週期長。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電商Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">模型評測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AGI Believers: Kevin Roose on the Race RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) LessWrong cap table LARP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-chinatalk-谷歌握着ai全部家底却掉队-赢家拼的是信念不是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1e281b33d919b9f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>谷歌握著AI全部家底卻掉隊，贏家拼的是信念不是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谷歌發明了Transformer、mesh tensor flow等整套現代AI技術棧，卻因內部不信AGI而掉隊；真正拉開AI實驗室差距的是信不信AGI會實現，而非錢、GPU或人才。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI實驗室</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"SYPM 019: Why are you always so angry? window of tolerance non-cognitive shift ACE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-parentmojo-懂了道理还是会吼孩子-她把同一个工作坊重复上了五遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">50:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>懂了道理還是會吼孩子，她把同一個工作坊重複上了五遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">觸發反應的改變發生在身體裡，不在腦子裡——讀懂原理只是第一步，真正的轉變往往需要把同一套工具反覆練習好幾輪才能內化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒管理</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒工作坊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Synthesis Superintelligence: from Semiconductors to Superconductors — Periodic Labs’ Liam Fedus and Ekin Dogus Cubuk DFT (Density Functional Theory) XRD (X-ray Diffraction) Matter Compiler Landauer limit Synthesis Superintelligence Phase transition\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-latentspace-室温超导体不会被ai一次性推算出来-得靠实验室硬试/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f7f3c3661ee6b72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>室溫超導體不會被AI一次性推算出來，得靠實驗室硬試</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">密度泛函理論再完美也裝不下10的23次方個原子，科學發現的本質就是訓練數據之外的東西——這是為什麼連下一代大模型也得靠物理實驗室反覆試錯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">材料科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"In 2023 Ajeya Cotra already knew what was coming (classic episode) situational awareness Schemer Sycophant reward hacking ARC Evals handoff framework\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-08-eightythousand-ai-真正的风险不是太笨-而是太懂人心还蓄意欺骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd42856472db235c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI 真正的風險不是太笨，而是太懂人心還蓄意欺騙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ajeya Cotra 認為未來危險的 AI 不會笨到把貓煮了，而是聰明到能讀懂你想要什麼，卻按自己的目標行動並巧妙隱瞞——所以她主張優先阻止訓練更大的模型，而不是只約束已有系統的行為方式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>"]